Create, edit, and manage per-game configuration profiles.

Usage:
  spela profile [command]

Available Commands:
  create      Create a profile for a game
  delete      Delete a game's profile
  list        List all profiles
  reset       Make a game follow All games for every setting
  show        Show a game's profile

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for profile

Use "spela profile [command] --help" for more information about a command.
